%% alt: Inside a serving engine: a scheduler batches requests continuously; prefill processes each whole prompt at once and fills the KV cache, which is stored in paged blocks; decode then produces one token per step, reading and extending the cache, and streams the tokens out.
flowchart TB
  R[Requests]:::human --> S[Scheduler<br/>continuous batching]:::control
  S --> P[Prefill<br/>whole prompt at once]:::model
  P --> KV[(KV cache<br/>paged blocks)]:::data
  KV <--> D[Decode<br/>one token per step]:::model
  D --> O[Streamed tokens]:::human
